  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now putting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;&amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp; in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math>, Similarly</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Now</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>512</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>k</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>512</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8943;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>512</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>512</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>512</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>512</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now comparing both side we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>512</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>128</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p>"
